{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>Google 於 2026 年 11 月 12 日發表 <a href=\"https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/models-and-research/gemini-models/introducing-gemini-4-hydrogen/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Gemini 4 Hydrogen</a>，並陸續推送至 Gemini app。新模型不再沿用「Flash」命名，Google 形容它為所有人帶來 cutting-edge intelligence，重點是日常編程與代理（agentic）工作流的速度與效率。本周早前 Google 才公佈同系的 <a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/2026/11/11/google-gemini-4-carbon-launch-analysis/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Carbon</a> 開放使用，兩者同屬 4 系列。</p><figure><p><img alt=\"Gemini app 模型選單列出 4 Hydrogen 等選項\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"613\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/667f58b834c600a137b78b155621b19cc930825f5297798eed6df677a471d207/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fnewmobilelife_722%2F7c15dbf22e67127dfee0d024fc8b58bc.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></figure><h2>不再叫 Flash　Gemini 4 Hydrogen 的定位</h2><p>Hydrogen 的上一代是 9 月 2 日推出的 Gemini 3.8 Flash。此後 Google 把重心放在 Argon 與 Carbon 等 frontier 模型，今次改用 Hydrogen 命名，等於把它納入新一代 4 系列。Google 稱它兼顧速度與效率，最複雜的工作留給 Carbon。</p><p></p><figure><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"472\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/e437413f0cf27f5f8101a03b82bcc8d655e1a52d7aa0062cca998f12be47cae5/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fnewmobilelife_722%2F0c292ddec9bb5746fc6c5f4ee1178a40\" width=\"960\"/></p></figure><h2>模型選單五級分工</h2><p>Gemini app 的模型選單按用途分為五級：Quick answers 對應 3.5 Flash-Lite，Everyday help 對應 4 Hydrogen，Detailed research 對應 3.1 Pro 並需要 AI Pro，Code &amp; analysis 對應 4 Argon，Most complex work 對應 4 Carbon。</p><p><p></p><p><p></p><p></p><p></p></p></p><p>Hydrogen 因此站在日常協助這一級，位置介於快速問答與編程分析之間。</p><figure><p><img alt=\"Gemini 字樣與四角星標誌的品牌視覺\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/26a3e3f75c5a7743a94549333ae364635d844b5164475df87b6f1419fbe6c2d9/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fnewmobilelife_722%2F2183bdf5c3a45192a1e605371d5884a3.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></figure><h2>跑分超越 Argon</h2><p>Google 指出，Hydrogen 在預設 high thinking 級別於 Artificial Analysis Intelligence Index 取得 51 分，超越 Argon 的 50 分；在最高 xhigh 設定可達 54 分。Google 同時稱，Hydrogen 完成任務往往比同級模型更快。</p><p>在 Google Antigravity，<a href=\"https://artificialanalysis.ai/models/gemini-4-hydrogen\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Gemini 4 Hydrogen 另設「Extra」thinking 級別</a>。Orchestrator 則讓 Carbon 把例行步驟分派給 Hydrogen 處理，官方稱品質與 Carbon 同級，但使用更少 token。由高階模型統籌、輕量模型執行例行步驟，是這套代理工作流的設計方向。</p><figure><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"711\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/9151bdfe297865757be4660556ac701b0569b172aff6c246a99f1fad803f5ae6/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fnewmobilelife_722%2F513ac27551ac13d5b522f3c30fe82d2d\" width=\"960\"/></p></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T21:04:14.713860+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":949,"images":4,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T18:45:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T21:17:51.458628+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T20:57:47.540383+00:00","content_hash":"1c34b5187160a0c2619b4d6a83bc1058f1d2c8d368f5f9f75a33e24a5ed54920","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}